WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.622
"This fort will be great," Rex said.

2
00:00:07.623 --> 00:00:17.526
He placed a big stick on the fort.

3
00:00:17.527 --> 00:00:22.800
Tor and Sid made the roof.

4
00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:28.055
"This looks good," Sid said.

5
00:00:28.056 --> 00:00:31.947
Soon the fort was done.

6
00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:35.214
"Let's get in!" Sara said.

7
00:00:35.215 --> 00:00:41.363
Sara crawled into the fort.

8
00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:45.498
"It's not very big in here," she said.

9
00:00:45.499 --> 00:00:50.083
"Make room for me," Sid said.

10
00:00:50.084 --> 00:00:53.469
"I'm coming in."

11
00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:57.417
"I can't move," Sara said.

12
00:00:57.418 --> 00:01:03.790
"The fort is too small!"

13
00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:06.387
"Oh well," Tor said.

14
00:01:06.388 --> 00:01:10.889
"We can just take turns."

15
00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:13.880
"That's no fun," Rex said.

16
00:01:13.881 --> 00:01:18.570
"Let's make the fort bigger."

17
00:01:18.571 --> 00:01:26.357
The buddies found more sticks.

18
00:01:26.358 --> 00:01:31.479
They made the fort bigger.

19
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:35.494
Soon the fort was done.

20
00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:46.000
The buddies crawled in.

21
00:01:46.001 --> 00:01:49.110
Squeak! Squeak!

22
00:01:49.111 --> 00:01:53.941
Rex saw a hole.

23
00:01:53.942 --> 00:01:57.357
"Oh no," he said.

24
00:01:57.358 --> 00:02:01.603
"That's the rat's hole!"

